          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.22.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yabo 22.14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwot Lubaŋa owacci, “Nen, dano doŋ odoko rom ki ŋat acel i kinwa, doŋ ŋeyo gin maber ki gin marac. Kombeddi pe dok wawek orye cine opwon nyig yat me kwo ocam doki, miyo doŋ bibedo makwo nakanaka.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumiyo Rwot Lubaŋa ocwale woko ki i poto Eden, wek odok opur gire ŋom ma yam gikwanye ki iye-ni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oryemo dano woko, ci oketo lukerubi yo tuŋ wokceŋ me poto Eden, ki pala lucwan ma lyel mac, ma wirre tuŋŋi ki tuŋŋi, me gwoko yo ma cito i kom yat me kwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
